{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-17T20:50:14.563Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"ddb2e572b3dc24915ab9fe76","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.326","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-03q389"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"picomatch through 4.0.7 has a high ReDoS advisory with no patched release (GHSA-fc5q-39xc-vjpf), so the dependency advisory gate blocks Gates (static) on every branch and the next release"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Found 2026-11-17 on PR 1746 when hosted Gates (static) failed at scripts/release/dependency-advisories/gate.mjs. GitHub updated advisory GHSA-fc5q-39xc-vjpf (npm advisory 1247710, high, ReDoS through single-branch repeated extglobs such as +(*)) on 2026-11-17 15:56Z to cover picomatch through 4.0.7, which is the latest release; first_patched_version is null. Both independent feeds report it (registry high count 1; OSV row picomatch 4.0.7), and the gate's all-severity policy (pm-eqxjzl: do not suppress actionable advisories) therefore blocks every run, including main, independent of any branch change; the lockfile is unchanged by PR 1746. Paths: tinyglobby (runtime, used by src/sdk/linked-artifacts.ts for linked-file globs), fdir via tinyglobby, and vite via @codspeed/vitest-plugin (dev). Exposure in pm: a caller-supplied linked-artifact glob compiled by picomatch could stall the process (self-inflicted). Upstream micromatch/picomatch opened fix PRs 257 to 261 on 2026-11-17 around 20:10Z; none is merged or released yet. Dependabot shows no open alert yet. Plan: when a patched picomatch is published, update the lockfile (direct pnpm update or an override to the patched version), confirm both feeds clear with node scripts/release/dependency-advisories/gate.mjs, and land it in a reviewed PR before the daily release cut; if no patch arrives, decide explicitly whether a time-bounded, recorded waiver belongs in the gate (it has none today)."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["advisory","dependency","github-alert","picomatch","release-blocker","security"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-17T20:50:14.563Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-17T20:50:14.563Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":45},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A patched picomatch is in the lockfile, or an explicit recorded decision covers the interim; node scripts/release/dependency-advisories/gate.mjs passes with both feeds clean; hosted Gates (static) passes on main and the daily release is not blocked"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-i7w2"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The dependency advisory gate passes with no actionable advisory in the lockfile"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Both advisory feeds report picomatch 4.0.7 (GHSA-fc5q-39xc-vjpf, no patched release) and the gate blocks every branch"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"dependencies"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-eqxjzl","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-17T20:50:14.563Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"